+# Usage: review-package PLAN_FILE BASE HEAD [OUTFILE] [TEST_COMMIT]
 # Default OUTFILE: <repo-root>/.superpowers/sdd/<plan-basename>/review-<base7>..<head7>.diff
 # (named per range, so a re-review after fixes gets a distinct fresh file).
+# An empty OUTFILE ("") also means the default. TEST_COMMIT adds an
+# "Acceptance-test changes" section: the test files that commit added or
+# changed (all its files if none look like tests), diffed TEST_COMMIT..HEAD
